Article 2 (Composition)
Administrative consultative councils under Article 96 of the Enforcement Decree of the Local Autonomy Act (hereinafter referred to as "councils") shall be composed as follows:
1. Capital Area Council: The Mayor of Seoul Special Metropolitan City, the Mayor of Incheon Metropolitan City and the Governor of Gyeonggi-do: Provided, That the Governor of Gangwon Special Self-Governing Province and the Governor of Chungcheongbuk-do may be included where necessary;
2. Metropolitan Area Councils: The relevant Mayors of Consolidated Special Cities, Mayors of Metropolitan Cities, Mayors of Special Self-Governing Cities, Do Governors and Governors of Special Self-Governing Provinces;
3. Other Councils: The relevant heads of Si, Gun and autonomous Gu.
